comment0.target=ElectricBike
comment0.text=\r\n Model the common elements of an Electric bike (EB) that operates \r\n within the simulation, moving towards a target and potentially recharging.\r\n * @author David J. Barnes and Michael K\u00F6lling\r\n @author DP classes\r\n @author Adri\u00E1n Serrat Leal\r\n @version 2026.10.13\r\n
comment1.params=company location targetLocation id batteryCapacity
comment1.target=ElectricBike(EBCompany, Location, Location, java.lang.String, int)
comment1.text=\r\n Constructor of class ElectricBike.\r\n @param company The EB's operating company. Must not be null.\r\n @param location The EB's starting {@link Location}. Must not be null.\r\n @param targetLocation The EB's final destination {@link Location}. Must not be null.\r\n @param id The identificator of the bike.\r\n @param batteryCapacity The maximum capacity of the battery.\r\n @throws NullPointerException If company, location, or targetLocation is null.\r\n
comment10.target=Location getRechargingLocation()
comment10.text=\r\n Returns the aimed recharging location, {@code null} if the bike is not headed to neither.\r\n @return The {@link Location} of the next {@link BikeStation} to visit, or {@code null} if no recharge is planned.\r\n
comment11.params=location
comment11.target=void setLocation(Location)
comment11.text=\r\n Set the current location.\r\n @param location Where it is. Must not be null.\r\n @throws NullPointerException If location is null.\r\n
comment12.params=location
comment12.target=void setTargetLocation(Location)
comment12.text=\r\n Set the required final target location.\r\n @param location Where to go. Must not be null.\r\n @throws NullPointerException If location is null.\r\n
